 "awards": {
  "about": "Per-sender counters in the engines' order: messages, words, attachments, late night (0-4 AM), tapbacks given, tapbacks received, laughs received, early (5-8 AM), questions, links, days started, days ended, longest run. Missing trailing counters are 0. `expect` is the whole list: [id, winner, detail].",
